---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
---

<section
  class="demo"
  data-demo="single-column"
  lang={lang}
  data-reset-message={t(
    "Initial state restored",
    "초기 상태로 복원했습니다",
    "初期状態に戻しました",
  )}
>
  <div class="controls">
    <label>
      {t("Preview width", "미리보기 폭", "表示幅")}
      <select data-width data-interactive disabled>
        <option value="wide">{t("Wide", "넓게", "広い")}</option>
        <option value="narrow">{t("Narrow", "좁게", "狭い")}</option>
      </select>
    </label>
  </div>
  <div class="frame">
    <nav aria-label={t("Reading path", "읽기 경로", "読書の順序")}>
      {t(
        "Journal / Fieldwork / 01",
        "저널 / 현장 조사 / 01",
        "日誌 / フィールドワーク / 01",
      )}
    </nav>
    <article>
      <small>06:40 / {t("JOURNAL", "저널", "日誌")}</small>
      <h2>{t("Before the city wakes", "도시가 깨기 전", "街が目覚める前")}</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        {t(
          "Follow one line of thought, from the first step to the last note.",
          "첫걸음부터 마지막 기록까지 하나의 생각을 따라갑니다.",
          "最初の一歩から最後の記録まで、ひとつの思考をたどります。",
        )}
      </p>
      <div class="landscape" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p>
        {t(
          "At dawn, the river path belongs to walkers. A bench marks the turn. We stop, look, and continue.",
          "새벽 강변 길은 걷는 사람들의 차지입니다. 벤치가 모퉁이를 표시합니다. 멈추고, 살피고, 다시 걷습니다.",
          "夜明けの川沿いは歩く人のもの。ベンチが曲がり角を示します。立ち止まり、眺め、また歩きます。",
        )}
      </p>
      <details>
        <summary>
          {t("Read another paragraph", "문단 더 읽기", "もう一段落読む")}
        </summary>
        <p>
          {t(
            "The route ends at a small bridge. Notes follow the same sequence as the walk, so the reader never has to choose a column.",
            "작은 다리에서 길이 끝납니다. 기록도 걸음과 같은 순서여서 독자는 읽을 열을 고를 필요가 없습니다.",
            "小さな橋で道は終わります。記録も散歩と同じ順序なので、読む列を選ぶ必要はありません。",
          )}
        </p>
      </details>
    </article>
    <aside>
      {t(
        "Related reading: a map of the river walk.",
        "함께 읽기: 강변 산책 지도.",
        "関連する読み物：川沿いの散歩地図。",
      )}
    </aside>
  </div>

  <button class="reset" type="button" data-reset data-interactive disabled>
    {t("Reset", "초기화", "リセット")}
  </button>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
</section>
<script>
  import { mount } from "./shared";
  mount("single-column", (root, say) => {
    const width = root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>("[data-width]")!;
    const frame = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".frame")!;
    width.addEventListener("change", () => {
      frame.dataset.width = width.value;
      say(width.selectedOptions[0].textContent!);
    });
    root
      .querySelector("details")!
      .addEventListener("toggle", () =>
        say(root.querySelector("summary")!.textContent!),
      );
    return () => {
      width.value = "wide";
      frame.dataset.width = "wide";
      root.querySelector("details")!.open = false;
    };
  });
</script>
<style>
  .demo {
    min-width: 0;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px);
    color-scheme: light;
  }
  .demo * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  h2,
  h3,
  p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 18px 0;
  }
  label {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
  button,
  select,
  input,
  textarea {
    font: inherit;
    max-width: 100%;
    color: inherit;
  }
  button,
  select,
  input:not([type="checkbox"]):not([type="range"]) {
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
  }
  button,
  select {
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  button {
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    background: transparent;
  }
  input,
  textarea,
  select {
    background: #fff;
    color: #172329;
    border: 1px solid #67747c;
  }
  input[type="range"] {
    width: 150px;
  }
  input[type="checkbox"] {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }
  :focus-visible {
    outline: 3px dashed currentColor;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
  [hidden] {
    display: none !important;
  }
  [role="status"] {
    min-height: 1.5em;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  small {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .reset {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .demo * {
      transition: none !important;
      animation: none !important;
    }
  }
  .demo {
    background: #edece6;
    color: #343a31;
  }
  .frame {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: auto;
    background: #fffdf6;
    padding: 24px;
    container-type: inline-size;
  }
  .frame[data-width="narrow"] {
    max-width: 300px;
  }
  nav,
  aside {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-block: 1px solid #b5b6aa;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  article {
    padding: 24px 0;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 7cqi, 3rem);
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .landscape {
    height: 120px;
    margin: 24px 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      165deg,
      #dedbcc 45%,
      #6b887e 46% 62%,
      #9bbebc 63%
    );
  }
  p {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
</style>
